A parametric OpenSCAD recreation of the Prusa ASA bicycle bottle cage: the
adjustable full-size cage with its slotted mount and the compact variant that
takes narrower bottles and clamps a thinner frame tube. Both sources plus the
upstream CC0 LICENSE, copied verbatim from the pinned commit. The rendered STL
exports, photographs and README are not vendored.

